{"step_index":531,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:00:47Z","thinking":"**Developing Problem Explorer**\n\nI'm currently focused on expanding `ProblemStatement.jsx` to create a multi-tab, LeetCode-style problem explorer. The first tab, \"[ 📑 Description ]\", is underway. I'm incorporating the problem's title, ID, difficulty, topics, formatted Markdown description, and example sections with input/output/explanation boxes and a constraints box.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import React, { useState } from 'react';\nimport { ExternalLink, Tag, BookOpen, Lightbulb, FileText, Code2, Clock, HardDrive, ChevronDown, ChevronRight, Sparkles } from 'lucide-react';\n\nexport const ProblemStatement = ({ problem }) => {\n  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState('DESCRIPTION');\n  const [revealedHints, setRevealedHints] = useState({});\n\n  if (!problem) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"p-6 text-center text-slate-500 font-mono text-xs\">\n        Loading problem statement...\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  let examplesList = [];\n  try {\n    if (problem.examples) {\n      examplesList = typeof problem.examples === 'string' ? JSON.parse(problem.examples) : problem.examples;\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    examplesList = [];\n  }\n\n  let hintsList = [];\n  try {\n    if (problem.hints) {\n      hintsList = typeof problem.hints === 'string' ? JSON.parse(problem.hints) : problem.hints;\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    hintsList = [];\n  }\n\n  const toggleHint = (idx) => {\n    setRevealedHints(prev => ({ ...prev, [idx]: !prev[idx] }));\n  };\n\n  const getDifficultyColor = (diff) => {\n    switch (diff) {\n      case 'EASY':\n        return 'bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-500/30';\n      case 'MEDIUM':\n        return 'bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border-amber-500/30';\n      case 'HARD':\n        return 'bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400 border-rose-500/30';\n      default:\n        return 'bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border-slate-700';\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"h-full flex flex-col bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n      {/* LeetCode Multi-Tab Navigation Bar */}\n      <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-1 px-3 py-2 bg-dark-800 border-b border-dark-700 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-none flex-shrink-0\">\n        <button\n          onClick={() => setActiveTab('DESCRIPTION')}\n          className={`flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold transition-colors ${\n            activeTab === 'DESCRIPTION'\n              ? 'bg-dark-700 text-cyan-400 font-bold border border-dark-500'\n              : 'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-dark-800'\n          }`}\n        >\n          <FileText className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n          <span>Description</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button\n          onClick={() => setActiveTab('EDITORIAL')}\n          className={`flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold transition-colors ${\n            activeTab === 'EDITORIAL'\n              ? 'bg-dark-700 text-indigo-400 font-bold border border-dark-500'\n              : 'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-dark-800'\n          }`}\n        >\n          <BookOpen className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n          <span>Editorial</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button\n          onClick={() => setActiveTab('SOLUTIONS')}\n          className={`flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold transition-colors ${\n            activeTab === 'SOLUTIONS'\n              ? 'bg-dark-700 text-emerald-400 font-bold border border-dark-500'\n              : 'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-dark-800'\n          }`}\n        >\n          <Code2 className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n          <span>Solutions</span>\n        </button>\n\n        {hintsList.length > 0 && (\n          <button\n            onClick={() => setActiveTab('HINTS')}\n            className={`flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold transition-colors ${\n              activeTab === 'HINTS'\n                ? 'bg-dark-700 text-amber-400 font-bold border border-dark-500'\n                : 'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-dark-800'\n            }`}\n          >\n            <Lightbulb className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n            <span>Hints ({hintsList.length})</span>\n          </button>\n        )}\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Tab 1: Problem Description */}\n      {activeTab === 'DESCRIPTION' && (\n        <div className=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-5 space-y-6 text-slate-200 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n          {/* Header */}\n          <div>\n            <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-1\">\n              <span className=\"font-bold text-cyan-400\">{problem.id}</span>\n              <span>•</span>\n              <span className=\"text-slate-400\">{problem.source || 'LeetCode'}</span>\n            </div>\n            <h1 className=\"text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">\n              {problem.title}\n            </h1>\n\n            {/* Badges */}\n            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mt-3\">\n              <span className={`px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold border ${getDifficultyColor(problem.difficulty)}`}>\n                {problem.difficulty}\n              </span>\n\n              {problem.topics && problem.topics.split(',').map((t, idx) => (\n                <span key={idx} className=\"text-[11px] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-dark-800 text-slate-300 border border-dark-700\">\n                  {t.trim()}\n                </span>\n              ))}\n\n              {problem.externalUrl && (\n                <a\n                  href={problem.externalUrl}\n                  target=\"_blank\"\n                  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                  className=\"flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-sans text-slate-400 hover:text-cyan-300 bg-dark-800 hover:bg-dark-700 border border-dark-600 transition-colors ml-auto\"\n                >\n                  <span>LeetCode Link</span>\n                  <ExternalLink className=\"w-3 h-3\" />\n                </a>\n              )}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Description */}\n          <div className=\"space-y-3 whitespace-pre-line text-slate-300\">\n            {problem.description}\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Examples */}\n          {examplesList && examplesList.length > 0 && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono\">\n                Examples\n              </h3>\n              {examplesList.map((ex, idx) => (\n                <div key={idx} className=\"bg-dark-800/80 rounded-xl p-3.5 border border-dark-700 space-y-2 font-mono text-xs\">\n                  <div className=\"font-bold text-slate-400 font-sans\">Example {idx + 1}:</div>\n                  <div>\n                    <span className=\"text-slate-400 font-semibold\">Input: </span>\n                    <code className=\"text-cyan-300\">{ex.input}</code>\n                  </div>\n                  <div>\n                    <span className=\"text-slate-400 font-semibold\">Output: </span>\n                    <code className=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">{ex.output}</code>\n                  </div>\n                  {ex.explanation && (\n                    <div className=\"text-slate-400 text-[11px] font-sans pt-1 border-t border-dark-700/60\">\n                      <span className=\"font-semibold text-slate-300\">Explanation: </span>\n                      {ex.explanation}\n                    </div>\n                  )}\n                </div>\n              ))}\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* Constraints */}\n          {problem.constraints && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n              <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono\">\n                Constraints\n              </h3>\n              <div className=\"bg-dark-800/60 rounded-xl p-3.5 border border-dark-700 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300 whitespace-pre-line\">\n                {problem.constraints}\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Tab 2: Editorial */}\n      {activeTab === 'EDITORIAL' && (\n        <div className=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-5 space-y-4 text-slate-200 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-indigo-400 font-bold font-mono text-xs\">\n            <BookOpen className=\"w-4 h-4\" />\n            <span>Official Editorial & Algorithmic Breakdown</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"bg-dark-800/80 rounded-xl p-4 border border-dark-700 whitespace-pre-line text-slate-300 font-sans text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n            {problem.editorial || problem.solutionExplanation || 'Editorial is currently being prepared for this problem.'}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Tab 3: Solutions */}\n      {activeTab === 'SOLUTIONS' && (\n        <div className=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-5 space-y-4 text-slate-200 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-emerald-400 font-bold font-mono text-xs\">\n            <Code2 className=\"w-4 h-4\" />\n            <span>Reference Solution Approaches</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"space-y-3\">\n            <div className=\"p-3 bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-dark-700 space-y-2\">\n              <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-cyan-300 font-mono\">Python 3 (One-Pass Hash Map - O(n))</div>\n              <pre className=\"bg-dark-900 p-3 rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-slate-200 overflow-x-auto\">\n{`class Solution:\n    def solve(self, nums: list[int], target: int) -> list[int]:\n        seen = {}\n        for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n            comp = target - num\n            if comp in seen:\n                return [seen[comp], i]\n            seen[num] = i\n        return []`}\n              </pre>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"p-3 bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-dark-700 space-y-2\">\n              <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-300 font-mono\">Java (Hash Map - O(n))</div>\n              <pre className=\"bg-dark-900 p-3 rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-slate-200 overflow-x-auto\">\n{`class Solution {\n    public int[] solve(int[] nums, int target) {\n        Map<Integer, Integer> map = new HashMap<>();\n        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n            int comp = target - nums[i];\n            if (map.containsKey(comp)) {\n                return new int[]{map.get(comp), i};\n            }\n            map.put(nums[i], i);\n        }\n        return new int[]{};\n    }\n}`}\n              </pre>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* Tab 4: Hints */}\n      {activeTab === 'HINTS' && (\n        <div className=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-5 space-y-3 text-slate-200 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-amber-400 font-bold font-mono text-xs mb-2\">\n            <Lightbulb className=\"w-4 h-4\" />\n            <span>Progressive Hints (Click to reveal)</span>\n          </div>\n\n          {hintsList.map((hint, idx) => (\n            <div key={idx} className=\"bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-dark-700 overflow-hidden\">\n              <button\n                onClick={() => toggleHint(idx)}\n                className=\"w-full px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-xs text-slate-300 hover:text-white flex items-center justify-between\"\n              >\n                <span>Hint {idx + 1}</span>\n                {revealedHints[idx] ? <ChevronDown className=\"w-4 h-4\" /> : <ChevronRight className=\"w-4 h-4\" />}\n              </button>\n              {revealedHints[idx] && (\n                <div className=\"px-4 py-3 bg-dark-900/60 border-t border-dark-700 text-xs text-slate-300 font-sans\">\n                  {hint}\n                </div>\n              )}\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n","Description":"ProblemStatement multi-tab component with Description, Editorial, Solutions, and Hints tabs","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\codeduel\\frontend\\src\\components\\ProblemStatement.jsx","toolAction":"Creating ProblemStatement.jsx","toolSummary":"Upgrade ProblemStatement to multi-tab LeetCode explorer"}}]}
